WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.520
Weeks later, a diff can tell you what
changed and leave you wondering why.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.361
The agent records why the default greeting
stays and points at the relevant line.

3
00:00:12.361 --> 00:00:16.280
Trail checks that the pointer
resolves when it writes the entry.

4
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:26.410
Give the trail the decision, a
short reason, and a place to look.

5
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.073
That makes the record useful
when you return to the work.
